\nwhile keeping MUL single-cycle. Hold the address and store payload together\\nunder data bus backpressure.\\n\\nShorten the remaining divider feedback while preserving its eight wait\\ncycles. Keep the four-bit launch seed. On the first iteration, process\\nthe next four bits in a narrow eight-bit restoring datapath while\\nregistering three times the unsigned divi\n…[24245 of 27317 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:3a16c83d566d1aa8]…\nrce npc = pc + 4 so the trace stays in\n        lockstep with the DUT (which suppresses redirects + reg/mem\n        commits on misalign / illegal).\"\"\"\n        if trap:\n            wrd = wval = 0\n            mem_addr = mem_rmask = mem_wmask = 0\n            mem_rdata = mem_wdata = 0\n            npc = (pc + 4) & MASK\n        if wrd:\n            self.regs[wrd] = wval\n        self.regs[0] = 0\n        self.pc = npc\n        out = {\n            'order': self.retired, 'pc': pc, 'npc': npc, 'insn': instr,\n            'rd': wrd, 'rd_wdata': wval if wrd else 0,\n            'rs1': rs1, 'rs1_rdata': rs1_rdata_pre,\n            'rs2': rs2, 'rs2_rdata': rs2_rdata_pre,\n            'mem_addr': mem_addr, 'mem_rmask': mem_rmask, 'mem_rdata': mem_rdata,\n            'mem_wmask': mem_wmask, 'mem_wdata': mem_wdata,\n            'trap': trap, 'halt': 0, 'intr': 0, 'mode': 3, 'ixl': 1,\n        }\n        self.retired += 1\n        return out\n\n    def step(self) -> Optional[dict]:\n        instr = self.rw(self.pc)\n        op  = instr & 0x7F\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
