{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"rg -n 'GOWIN_HOME|GOWIN_LICENSE' tools/eval/{gowin,fpga}.py; command -v verilator; command -v yosys; ls -d /opt/* /tools/* 2>/dev/null; rg 'hyp-20261121-001-r4s0' cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl | python3 -c 'import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d[\\\"implementation_notes\\\"].split(\\\"## Local verification\\\")[1])'\"","aggregated_output":"tools/eval/gowin.py:22:GOWIN_HOME = Path(os.environ.get(\"GOWIN_HOME\", \"/opt/gowin\"))\ntools/eval/gowin.py:35:    libs = [GOWIN_HOME / \"deps/root/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu\", GOWIN_HOME / \"IDE/lib\"]\ntools/eval/gowin.py:133:        proc = subprocess.Popen([str(GOWIN_HOME / \"IDE/bin/gw_sh\"), \"build.tcl\"], cwd=outdir,\n/srv/hwebench/toolchain/oss-cad-suite/bin/verilator\n/srv/hwebench/toolchain/oss-cad-suite/bin/yosys\n/opt/gowin\n/opt/hwe-python\n/opt/hwe-toolchain\n\n\n- Verilator `-Wall` lint passed in both hardware and ALTOPS modes.\n- All seven cocotb suites passed. The added coverage checks forwarded offsets across 4 KiB boundaries, 32-bit address wraparound, load and store alignment traps, subword lanes, a held store, register reset and bypass, and all four divide operations at divisor magnitudes 255 and 256 and with wide unsigned operands.\n- `bash formal/run_all.sh` passed all 53 single-channel ALTOPS checks, including `reg_ch0`, with zero corrective retries. A separate induction check on the synthesized register-file model proved both read ports equivalent to the original after reset for arbitrary write sequences.\n- `NRET=1 make cosim TARGET=bench` passed selftest against the ISS with and without stalls and passed stalled CoreMark CRC validation.\n\n## Gowin score\n\n`NRET=1 make fpga TARGET=bench` completed all three placements.\n\n| Placement | Fmax (MHz) |\n| --- | ---: |\n| 0 | 62.587 |\n| 1 | 64.657 |\n| 2 | 64.657 |\n\nThe median of **64.657 MHz** gives **154.30 CoreMark iterations/sec** at 10 iterations in 4,190,307 timed cycles. That is **11.06% above the champion** and 6.41 iterations/sec below the scratch result. Placement zero used 3,443 logic cells, 805 registers, 36 LUT RAMs, four block RAMs, and two DSPs.\n\nThe worst setup path starts at MEM/WB's destination register and crosses forwarding into the ordinary ALU in placement zero and into the divider launch seed in placements one and two.\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
