lt mux as ordinary ALU operations and are the likely\\nsource of the deep logic. Every instruction pays their timing cost.\\nAn unmodified baseline cosim with both bus stalls enabled reproduced\\nthe logged 4,491,485 bracketed cycles and passed CoreMark CRC validation.\\nIts 2,922,015 timed retirements included zero DIV, DIVU, REM or REMU\\ninstructions.\\n\", 'hypothesis': \"Move DIV, DIVU, REM and REMU into one blocking, clocked execute unit. At\\nlaunch, capture forwarded operands and the operation, and register the\\noperand magnitudes an\n…[25816 of 28888 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:9bef4650486c408a]…\n': 12, 'confidence': 'medium'}\noutcome improvement\nfitness 192.82\ndelta_pct 14.15\nvs_baseline 1490.92\nfmax_mhz 76.281\nipc_coremark 3e-06\ncycles 3956104\niterations 10\nlut4 4082\nff 1444\nseeds [75.359, 76.281, 76.281]\nperturbations [[0, 75.359, 17], [1, 76.281, 18], [2, 76.281, 18]]\nlutram 40\nbsram 4\ndsp 2\ncritical_path {'from': 'cpu/u_ex/u_div/remainder_q_1_s1', 'to': 'cpu/u_ex/u_div/remainder_q_2_s1', 'slack_ns': -8.27, 'arrival_ns': 18.564, 'logic_cells': 28, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_ex/u_div']}\nlogic_levels 17\nformal_passed True\ncosim_passed True\nerror None\nimplementation_notes \ntimestamp 2026-11-21T16:38:39.213371Z\nslot 1\nround_id 6\nlesson - 2026-11-21 hyp-20261121-002-r6s1 (improvement, +14.15%): Registering one-hot bypass selects in ID and capturing forwarded DIV/REM operands before seed computation raised median Gowin Fmax from 66.827 to 76.281 MHz at unchanged CoreMark cycles, with EX/MEM retirement after older work drained recovering the added divide cycle to meet the ten-cycle liveness bound.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
