rry-in one candidates locally in each 8-bit block. Compute\\ngroup carries in parallel from block propagate and generate signals,\\nthen select each byte. Use the existing ALU operand choices for PC,\\nimmediate and register inputs. This gives the sum a short path from\\noperand forwarding to its own register, with modulo-2^32 wraparound.\\n\\nOn ID acceptance, resolve producer age first and register a one-hot\\nmask selecting the future EX/MEM lane, the future MEM/WB write value,\\nor the captured register-file value for each raw source. Form the masked\\nEX/MEM lane terms in parallel with the MEM/WB and register-file terms\\nand OR them in the \n…[19764 of 22836 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:cd2cc8841c7637eb]…\netch\\nplacement pressure. The packed scratch build reproduced the cycle count\\nand CRCs and passed selftest and all three RVFI random traces with and\\nwithout bus stalls. At that cycle count the tournament margin requires\\na median above 91.85 MHz. Target 92.3 MHz for 265.84 iterations per\\nsecond, up 5.1%. Confirm all three placements and run the existing formal\\nand RVFI gates.\\n\", 'expected_impact': {'fitness_delta_pct': 5, 'confidence': 'low'}, 'changes': [{'file': 'rtl/if_stage.sv', 'description': 'Learn two-step successor hints from accepted fetch words. Pack validity in the hint RAM, steer the existing synchronous replay read, stage collision checks and precompute replay successors. Preserve bus recovery, boundary parking and invalidation.'}, {'file': 'test/test_pipeline.py', 'description': 'Exercise a learned taken path, a sequential correction, source and replay tag aliases, stalled requests and FENCE.I. Verify ordered RVFI and suppression of wrong-path side effects.'}]}, 'implementation_notes': ''}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
