: The module \"wb_stage\" instantiated to \"u_wb\" is swept in optimizing(\"/srv/hwebench/tmp/58928045/b8d89e62/r14s1.odi9SSA7/cores/bench/rtl/core.sv\":198)\n[95%] Generate netlist file \"/srv/hwebench/tmp/58928045/b8d89e62/r14s1.odi9SSA7/cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p1/impl/gwsynthesis/core_bench.vg\" completed\n[100%] Generate report file \"/srv/hwebench/tmp/58928045/b8d89e62/r14s1.odi9SSA7/cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p1/impl/gwsynthesis/core_bench_syn.rpt.html\" completed\nGowinSynthesis finish\nReading netlist file: \"/srv/hwebench/tmp/58928045/b8d89e62/r14s1.odi9SSA7/cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p1/impl/gwsynthesis/core_bench.vg\"\nParsing netlist file \"/srv/hwebench/tmp/58928045/b8d89e62/r14s1.odi9SSA7/cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p1/impl/gwsynthesis/core_bench.vg\" completed\nProcessing netlist completed\nReading constraint file: \"/srv/hwebench/tmp/58928045/b8d89e62/r14s1.odi9SSA7/fpga/constraints/Tang_Nano_20K.cst\"\nPhysical Constraint parsed completed\nRunning placement......\n[10%] Placement Phase 0 completed\n[20%] Placement Phase 1 completed\n[30%] Placement Phase 2 completed\n..","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
