{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"agent_message","text":"The sliced-adder prototype preserved the CoreMark cycle count, but its median Fmax fell to 77.35 MHz. Profiling also found about 195,000 cycles with an empty fetch queue and an unready instruction bus while the back end could accept work. I’m testing whether registered replay can recover those cycles without putting a RAM read in the same-cycle PC feedback path."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c 'scratch=$(cat \"$TMPDIR/bench-r15s1-dir\")\nfor variant in stream twin\ndo\n  mkdir -p \"$scratch/$variant/cores/bench\"\n  cp -r \"$scratch/cores/bench/rtl\" \"$scratch/cores/bench/core.yaml\" \"$scratch/$variant/cores/bench/\"\n  cp -r \"$scratch/fpga\" \"$scratch/$variant/\"\ndone\npython - \"$scratch\" <<'\"'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport sys\nscratch = Path(sys.argv[1])\nfor variant in ('stream','twin'):\n p=scratch/variant/'cores/bench/rtl/if_stage.sv'\n s=p.read_text()\n s=s.replace(\\\"  logic        lookup_valid_q, lookup_hit;\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"  logic        lookup_valid_q, lookup_hit;\n  logic        read_current_hit;\n  prediction_t read_current_prediction;\\\"\\\"\\\")\n if variant == 'stream':\n  s=s.replace(\\\"  assign lookahead_word = predicted_pc_q[19:2] + 18'd2;\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"  always_comb begin\n    lookahead_word = predicted_pc_q[19:2] + 18'd2;\n    if (recovery_pending_q) lookahead_word = next_pc[19:2];\n    else if (normal_bus_valid && candidate_taken[NORMAL]) lookahead_word = candidate_target[NORMAL];\n    else if (normal_accept_replay && replay_prediction.taken) lookahead_word = replay_prediction.target;\n    else if (\"'!normal_bus_valid && !(|replay_match) && !read_current_hit)\n      lookahead_word = predicted_pc_q[19:2];\n  end\n  assign read_current_hit = lookup_hit && lookup_word_q == predicted_pc_q[19:2];\n  assign read_current_prediction = lookup_record_q.prediction;\"\"\")\n  s=s.replace(\"lookup_valid_q <= !sweeping_q && predicted_in_window_q\", \"lookup_valid_q <= !sweeping_q && (predicted_in_window_q || recovery_pending_q)\")\n else:\n  s=s.replace(\"  assign lookahead_word = predicted_pc_q[19:2] + 18'\"'d2;\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"  logic [17:0]   direct_word_q;\n  logic          direct_valid_q;\n  prediction_record_t direct_record_q;\n  (* syn_ramstyle = \\\"block_ram\\\" *) logic [RECORD_WIDTH-1:0] direct_ram [0:1023];\n\n  assign lookahead_word = predicted_pc_q[19:2] + 18'd2;\n  always_ff @(posedge clock) begin\n    if (ram_write_en) direct_ram[ram_write_index] <= ram_write_data;\n    direct_record_q <= direct_ram[next_pc[11:2]];\n    direct_word_q <= next_pc[19:2];\n    direct_valid_q <= \"'!reset && !fence_i && !sweeping_q && next_in_window\n                   && !(fill_pending_q && fill_index_q == next_pc[11:2]);\n  end\n  assign read_current_hit = direct_valid_q && direct_record_q.valid\n                          && direct_record_q.tag == direct_word_q[17:10]\n                          && direct_word_q == predicted_pc_q[19:2];\n  assign read_current_prediction = direct_record_q.prediction;\"\"\")\n s=s.replace(\"    replay_prediction = '\"'0;\\\", \\\"\\\"\\\"    replay_prediction = (|replay_match) || \"'!read_current_hit\n                        ? '\"'0 : read_current_prediction;\\\"\\\"\\\")\n s=s.replace(\\\"assign normal_accept_replay = (|replay_match) && predicted_in_window_q && \"'!parked_q\", \"assign normal_accept_replay = ((|replay_match) || read_current_hit) && predicted_in_window_q && !parked_q && !predicted_last_word_q\")\n s=s.replace(\"(replay_taken && (|replay_target_last))\", \"(replay_taken && ((|replay_target_last) || (!(|replay_match) && (&read_current_prediction.target))))\")\n p.write_text(s)\nPY\nfor variant in stream twin\ndo\n  (NRET=1 RTL_DIR=\"$scratch/$variant/cores/bench/rtl\" OBJ_DIR=\"$scratch/$variant/obj\" bash test/cosim/build.sh > \"$scratch/$variant/verilator.log\" 2>&1 &&\n   \"$scratch/$variant/obj/cosim_sim\" \"$scratch/sliced/bench/programs/coremark.elf\" 50000000 --bench --istall --dstall > \"$scratch/$variant/coremark.log\") &\n  (python -m tools.eval.gowin bench --worktree \"$scratch/$variant\" --all-options --paths 5 > \"$scratch/$variant/timing.log\") &\ndone\nwait\nfor variant in stream twin; do printf '\"'%s\\\\n' \\\"\"'$variant\"; tail -n 1 \"$scratch/$variant/coremark.log\"; cat \"$scratch/$variant/timing.log\"; done'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
