{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_81","type":"agent_message","text":"Wrote and schema-validated one structural hypothesis for `cores/bench`: read four possible fetch successors in parallel so replay can supply the selected instruction during bus stalls. [Hypothesis YAML](/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6_2-sol_xhigh-v2-rep4/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261122-002-r15s1-hypgen/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261122-002-r15s1.yaml)\n\nThe staged-fill prototype passed the canonical CoreMark CRC checks and cut timed cycles by **4.34%**. At **87.342 MHz** median Gowin Fmax, it scored **269.73 iter/s**, up **1.84%**. Acceptance requires a median above **89.712 MHz** at that cycle count. Ready and stalled ISS cosimulation passed. The scratch formal run passed liveness and timed out before completing the full suite."}}
